OL,3,CTV-related anniversaries for 01 SEP
OL,4,CCHANNELS
OL,5,
OL,6,CG1939FThe BBC Television Service
OL,7,Fcloses down due to the outbreak of
OL,8,FWorld War II.
OL,9,
OL,10,FThe final programme transmitted was a
OL,11,FMickey Mouse cartoon, Mickey's Gala
OL,12,FPremier.
OL,13,
OL,14,CG1961FBorder Television - the ITV
OL,15,Ffranchisee for the England-Scotland
OL,16,Fborder and Isle of Man - begins
OL,17,Fbroadcasting.
OL,18,
OL,19,CG1962FChannel Television - the ITV
OL,20,Ffranchisee for the Channel Islands -
OL,21,Fbegins broadcasting.
OL,22,
OL,23,Sppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
