OL,4,CCHANNELS
OL,5,
OL,6,CG1984FThe Children's Channel begins
OL,7,Fbroadcasting almost exclusively to
OL,8,Fcable households (as opposed to via
OL,9,Fsatellite) in the UK and Europe.
OL,10,
OL,11,CG1989FITV launches its first attempt
OL,12,Fat a proper corporate identity.
OL,13,
OL,14,FThe 1989 ITV logo is the first
OL,15,Fconcerted effort to turn ITV into a
OL,16,Fbrand although there had been previous
OL,17,Fattempts at generic logos - notably the
OL,18,F"rainbow" ITV blocks seen on some
OL,19,Ftrailers from the mid-1980s, which also
OL,20,Finspired the ITV Schools graphics on
OL,21,FChannel 4.
OL,22,
OL,23,Sppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
