OL,5,
OL,6,CG1993FUK Living begins broadcasting.
OL,7,
OL,8,FIn 1997 the channel was rebranded as
OL,9,FLiving. It was renamed again in 2011 to
OL,10,FSky Living.
OL,11,
OL,12,FOn 6th August 2018, Sky Living became
OL,13,FSky Witness.
OL,14,
