OL,5,
OL,6,CG1993FThe Family Channel begins
OL,7,Fbroadcasting in the UK at 5pm.
OL,8,
OL,9,FThe launch is counted down by Darren
OL,10,FDay in the gallery.
OL,11,
OL,12,FIn 1997, the channel would be renamed
OL,13,FChallenge.
