OL,4,CCHANNELS
OL,5,
OL,6,CG1993FBritish Sky Broadcasting
OL,7,Flaunches Sky Multichannels - a package
OL,8,Fof analogue television channels
OL,9,Favailable from 1st September 1993 to
OL,10,F27th September 2001.
OL,11,
OL,12,FThe package started off with 14
OL,13,Fchannels and eventually expanded to
OL,14,Fover 40.
OL,15,
OL,16,CG1996FThe Computer Channel begins
OL,17,Fbroadcasting in the UK.
OL,18,
OL,19,FIt was rebranded .tv in 1998.
OL,20,
OL,21,
