OL,5,
OL,6,CG1996FSky Two begins broadcasting.
OL,7,
OL,8,FThe channel closed a year later, before
OL,9,Freappearing in 2005 following the
OL,10,Frebrand of Sky Mix.
OL,11,
OL,12,FIn August 2020, Sky Two was rebranded
OL,13,Fas Sky Replay.
OL,14,
OL,15,CG1997FThe National Geographic channel
OL,16,Fbegins broadcasting in the UK.
OL,17,
OL,18,CG1999FNick Jnr begins broadcasting in
OL,19,Fthe UK.
