OL,5,
OL,6,CG2021FSky Showcase begins
OL,7,Fbroadcasting. The channel replaces Sky
OL,8,FOne. The new channel shows a selection
OL,9,Fof programmes from Sky's diverse
OL,10,Fportfolio of channels.
OL,11,
OL,12,CG2021FSky Max begins broadcasting.
OL,13,
OL,14,FThe channel is home to entertainment
OL,15,Fand drama productions.
OL,16,
OL,17,CG2021FSky One ceases broadcasting just
OL,18,Fbefore 6am.
OL,19,
OL,20,FIt's replaced by Sky Showcase.
